 "result_text": "I fixed the `IndexError` by adding `0` to the end of `LUX_MAPPING_VALUES` in `src/uiprotect/data/devices.py`. I haven't run the tests or the camera code against it.\n\nThe list only had 10 entries (30 down to 1). `icr_lux_display` looks up `LUX_MAPPING_VALUES[10 - icr_custom_value]`, so an `icr_custom_value` of 0 asked for index 10 and failed. With the extra entry, 0 now displays as 0 lux.\n\n`set_icr_custom_lux` needed no change. For a lux value of 0 it already ended up with `icr_custom_value` 0.",
